          <h3>Elevator Project</h3>
          <p>The elevator project was a team project in a software engineering class. This was an exercise in agile development. In the span of 4 weeks, we were tasked with creating an elevator simulator. Each week we needed to have a project that we could display, even if it didn’t have complete functionality. I was in charge of the physical functions behind the graphic interface, specifically the cabin motion and the door controls. Besides this being an interesting coding assignment, this project demonstrated the challenges of working in a team and the importance of communication..</p>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/clfm/Elevator">View Project
