          <h3>Hokm</h3>
          <p>I designed a terminal game based on a classic Persian card game. I developed the game in Python. The game consists of three main components. These are the game loop, the comparator, and the individual players. The game loop uses the players and the comparator to gain information about the state of the game. The main exercise for this project was in designing an Artificial Intelligence. The first iteration was simple in the decision making process while the second iteration uses a more in depth decision tree. In the next iteration a recurrent neural net will be utilized.</p>
