          <h3>3D Game of Life</h3>
          <p>This project was a variation on Conway’s Game of Life in three dimensions. I used JavaFX for the graphics for this project. Besides being in 3D, this variation of the game allows the user to set their own rules. When a cell is dying, it will shrink and eventually disappear and will increase in size as a new cell is born. In order to better visualize these functionalities, the user can set the speed of the game updates.</p>
